flf2a$ 9 9 14 -1 6 0 0 0
Cosmeron -- futuristic geometric orbit FIGfont, 2026.
Reference: angular COSMERON wordmark with a circular orbital O and a power-styled second O.
Unicode box-drawing glyphs; use a terminal and FIGlet renderer with UTF-8 support.
O = ring with core dot; digit 0 = ring with power bar (type COSMER0N for logo variant).
Height 9; each glyph 12 terminal cells wide; full-width layout; no fitting or smushing.
Original design, license EUPL-1.2-or-later. Earlier 0/1 font is NibbleBits.flf.
